  (text "M.2 M-key 2230/2242 NVMe on PCIE (Gen 2 x1), 3.3 V from +3V3_P, PERST#, CLKREQ#.\nM.2 B-key 3042/3052 (USB3 + USB2 from VL817 P1), nano-SIM push-push holder,\nW_DISABLE#, FULL_CARD_POWER_OFF# on GPIO, RESET#; 3.3 V bulk 470 uF for TX bursts.\nAntennas from the modem by U.FL pigtails (MAIN, DIV, GNSS) to the top SMA panel." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 25.00 0)
